      "id": "https://newatlas.com/ai-humanoids/living-computers-forge-a-hive-mind-and-work-together-to-outsmart-ai/",
      "url": "https://newatlas.com/ai-humanoids/living-computers-forge-a-hive-mind-and-work-together-to-outsmart-ai/",
      "title": "Living computers forge a 'hive mind' and work together to outsmart AI",
      "content_html": "<p><img alt=\"The linked-up neural chips divided tasks between them to complete tests with more accuracy and efficiency\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/91887db/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6000x3375+0+0/resize/1440x810!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd4%2F8e%2F8b9a052747869f924cfe2a9c2d4d%2Frendering-neuron-cells-glowing-human-depositphotos-380455096-xl.jpg\"/><p>In a new twist on the phrase \"two heads are better than one,\" the makers of the world's first biological computer has found that putting 15 of these synthetic brains together has resulted in their collective human neurons working better and smarter.</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/ai-humanoids/living-computers-forge-a-hive-mind-and-work-together-to-outsmart-ai/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/ai-humanoids/\">AI and Humanoids</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/technology/\">Technology</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/organoid/\" rel=\"tag\">organoid</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/neurons/\" rel=\"tag\">neurons</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/neural-network/\" rel=\"tag\">Neural Network</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/computers/\" rel=\"tag\">Computers</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/biocomputers/\" rel=\"tag\">Biocomputers</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/chips/\" rel=\"tag\">Chips</a></p></p>",
